## The Challenge Enterprise data platforms are notoriously cluttered. Operators

at Nexus were spending up to 45 minutes configuring custom queries and
deciphering nested tables before making mission-critical decisions. The goal was
clear: **turn complexity into clarity**. ## The Solution We completely
overhauled the core navigation architecture, introduced an intent-driven filter
bar, and designed modular dashboard widgets that adapt to user roles. ### Key
Outcomes - **64% reduction** in query setup time. - **Zero training required**
for newly onboarded team members. - Adoption score jumped from 42% to **89% in**
**the first quarter**. > "The new dashboard gave our operators clarity they had
never experienced before with legacy software."
